{"ID":"20240205165636-vszkdl3","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205165636-vszkdl3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165636-vszkdl3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206083053-4pdo0xo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206090619-73eu1ae\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:964,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206090619-73eu1ae\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"党参","type":"doc","updated":"20240830141716"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206083053-4pdo0xo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083053-4pdo0xo","updated":"20240206083056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产甘肃、山西、陕西、四川等地。\n【性状】\t呈长圆柱形，稍弯曲，长1035cm，直径0.42cm。根上端1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3cm部分有环纹，质稍软，断面裂隙少。味微酸。根头部有多数疣状突起的茎痕的顶端呈凹下的圆点状；根头下有致密的环状横纹，向下渐稀疏，有的达全长的一半，栽培品环纹少或无；全体有纵皱纹及散在的横长皮孔，支根断落处常有黑褐色胶状物。质稍硬或略带韧性，断面稍平坦，有裂隙或放射状纹理，皮部淡黄白色至淡棕色，木部淡黄色。有特殊香气，味微甜。\n【性味】\t甘、微酸，性平。\n【功效】\t补中益气，健脾益肺。用于脾肺虚弱，气短心悸，食少便溏，虚喘咳嗽，内热消渴。\n【炙品】\t炒党参：将大米置热的炒药锅内，用中火加热至冒烟时，投入党参片拌炒，至党参呈黄色时取出，筛去米，放凉。每100kg党参片，用米20kg。炙品表面老黄色，具香气，余同生党参片。\n炙党参：取炼蜜用适量开水稀释后，与党参片拌匀，闷透，置热炒药锅内，用文火加热，不断翻炒至黄棕色，不黏手时取出，放凉。每100kg党参片，用炼蜜20kg。炙品形如党参片，表面黄棕色，显光泽，味甜。\n【注解】\t“狮子盘头”指条粗党参根头部有多数疣状突起的茎痕及芽，每个茎痕顶端呈凹下的圆点状，形如狮子头。\n“菊花心”指药材横断面的放射状纹理，形如开放的菊花。\n“皮松肉紧”指部分根类药材的横断面皮部疏松，而木部较为结实。\n“化渣”指药材经口嚼而无残渣。"}]},{"ID":"20240206083046-0urh754","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083046-0urh754","updated":"20240206083046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206083046-lsj8vq2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165743-2uz8j3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165743-2uz8j3t","updated":"20240205165743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"党参"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/党参-20240205165743-0p4kjkz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709165227-dk3it4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709165227-dk3it4n","updated":"20240709165325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"党参"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/党参-20240709165227-dcoet48.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 473px;","style":"width: 463px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"党参 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/党参 1-20240709165325-5whrw19.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 463px;\" parent-style=\"width: 473px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709165404-dq6ybg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709165404-dq6ybg7","updated":"20240709165404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 499px;","style":"width: 489px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"党参 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/党参 2-20240709165404-vyzg91u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSp